From 14c47c172a7075bcb432a08b7d494ac466d44def Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:37:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] notifications: add option to remove old notifications from
 the history

Notifications stayed in the history until the user cleared it by hand,
which some people don't want for privacy reasons. Add a setting to
remove them automatically after an hour, a day or a week, or never.

BUG: 524431
